Summary: ATLAS single vector-like T-quark production search in the fully hadronic T->Ht channel at 13 TeV with 139/fb
InspireID: 2013051
ExptRun: ATLAS-R2
Lumi_ifb: 139.0
Ecm_TeV: 13.0
Signatures: ["0L + >=1H + >=1T + >=3B"]
Keywords: ["vectorlikequark", "singleproduction", "fully-hadronic", "Higgs-tag", "top-tag", "large-R-jet"]
