Note: The fully hadronic signal region requires one Higgs-tagged large-R jet consistent with H->bb and one top-tagged large-R jet, together with at least three associated b-tagged jets. The source sets a rounded luminosity of 140/fb; the publication metadata and analysis description use 139/fb.
